Relatively easy. I joined Auckland housing groups on Facebook and that's how I found my flat (another place to look for flats is
Trademe.nz
). Viewed a few different flats (through video calls from home) and it was all pretty smooth. However, most flats are posted relatively close to the move-in date, so it was a little bit stressful, as I only found my flat a few weeks before going.
